o augment your cards, which are earned through a variety of means throughout the campaign. As you travel through each of the enemy territories you will have the opportunity to recruit enemy units and salvage foreign promotion gems to unlock a nearly unlimited combination of game-breaking effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/d0753888154eb3eaf40b319e6dea9693.poster.avif?t=1755293725\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/d0753888154eb3eaf40b319e6dea9693.webm?t=1755293725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/d0753888154eb3eaf40b319e6dea9693.mp4?t=1755293725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Adventure Begins </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure pushes your Champion through three procedural enemy regions, offering a unique experience every time. Choose your path through enemy territory wisely, selecting between challenging encounters with greater rewards on your way to the final clash with an epic Champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemy encounters to collect money and new cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Special battle locations to earn promotion gems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mini-bosses to collect relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stores to buy and trade resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Taverns to collect missions with special rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Portal anomalies that lead to distant regions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shortcuts unlocked by bribing the locals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/9fa9d4ab939df291b3d29b1368d49d33.poster.avif?t=1755293725\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/9fa9d4ab939df291b3d29b1368d49d33.webm?t=1755293725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/9fa9d4ab939df291b3d29b1368d49d33.mp4?t=1755293725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dragon Front: Adventures </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 hostile regions/factions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 25 unique units and 15 spells per region</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 unique champions per region \u2013 each with legendary abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 mini-bosses per region</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 battle mutators per region</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 supply cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 50+ relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon Front: Adventures is currently being developed.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dragon Front: Adventures is a turn-based, tug-of-war roguelike where you take charge of a legendary Champion and build your forces by collecting units, spells, supplies and relics. Explore unique combinations to overwhelm the opposition.",
